Manage prospect s in the SMB segment from qualified lead to closing;
Use outbound selling strategies to create pipeline and find new business;
Position and articulate the Aircall value proposition to your prospects;
Educate prospects through complex sales-cycles in order to create excitement and enthusiasm across multiple stakeholders;
Work side by side with Sales & Business Development Representatives to identify business opportunities in your pipeline;
Forecast your monthly revenue achievements, crush your quota and deliver revenue ;
Represent Aircall with integrity and p rofessionalism at all times in all written and oral communications.

Own the full sales cycle with our target merchants - from the prospecting stage to delivering realised margin.
Creatively drive innovation for merchants in retail, digital, platforms, and financial services;
Work closely with our commercial engine (Sales, BDR, Marketing and Partnerships) to drive pipeline in defined target sectors
Become an expert in selling Adyen's world class financial solutions;
Partner with technology leaders and solution providers while working closely with our Sales Support, Implementation and Account Management teams;
Travel and network (~25%);

Have at least 4 years of experience managing the whole Sales cycle, from prospecting to closing. Prospection is a key part of the role;
Have full working proficiency in French (C2 and above) and an advanced level in English .
Are highly organized with exceptional follow-up skills ;
Have empathy and are passionate about understanding and solving prospects' problems;
Can influence through persuasion, negotiation, and consensus-building;
Have a deep understanding of value drivers in recurring revenue business models;
Have a great attitude and ability to collaborate in a small team;
Are eager to learn fast and make an impact from day 1;
Are based in (or willing to relocate to) Paris, Bordeaux, Marseille, Lyon, Annecy, Nantes or Biarritz.
For this opportunity, we are aiming to hire within the C0-D level range .
If you're still wondering whether this could be the best move for you, take a look at this article from Lucie Leflour, our Sales Lead in France.
Everything else is a plus. We care about having a diversity of experiences, profiles and backgrounds in our team.

Become an expert in retargeting technologies and other RTB House products, and adapt them to specific customers’ needs;
Provide dedicated account management to direct clients in France, respond to clients’ requests and inquiries in a professional and timely manner;
Create retargeting strategies in multiple industries (retail, automotive, beauty, travel, energy …) based on data analysis and your own expertise;
Consult and educate clients to ensure customer success;
Assist customers in the process of launching ad campaigns;
Obtain, review and process customer orders;
Negotiate campaign business terms;
Provide dedicated reports for our clients;
Analyse data in order to optimise campaigns’ performance
Identify upsell opportunities
Execute customer communication – in line with standards and processes, incl. regular face to face meetings
Work hand in hand with Sales and Technical account management team to ensure the best results and service are delivered to the clients
Travelling required ~10% of time

Assurer une gestion de compte dédiée aux clients directs en France, répondre aux demandes des clients dans les meilleurs délais ;
Créer des stratégies de retargeting dans de multiples secteurs (retail, automobile, beauté, voyage, énergie…) basées sur l'analyse des données et votre propre expertise ;
Consulter et former les clients pour assurer leur réussite ;
